                    // is null" (SH184). String args (x2/x3/x4) resolve via 0x21e1fec (SH186 slot-169
                    // identity shim => empty jstrings resolve). Gates on version [0x10683cff8].
                    // Opt-in --v2boot-session-set; consumer, nil-milestone either way.
